Package: linux-image-4.9-337-oneplus-fajita
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for OnePlus 6T (fajita)
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the OnePlus 6T (fajita) device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-4.9-337-oneplus-fajita package for a bootimage
 suitable for Android boot loaders.

Package: linux-bootimage-4.9-337-oneplus-fajita
Architecture: arm64
Pre-Depends: flash-bootimage (>= 4)
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         linux-image-4.9-337-oneplus-fajita (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Linux kernel for OnePlus 6T (fajita) - Android Boot Image
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the OnePlus 6T (fajita) device.
 .
 Note: This package ships an Android Boot Image bundled with Halium's
 initramfs.

